# Local dev env. What these do is documented in README.md and SELFHOST.md.
# Hosts set the same variables in their own environment, which wins over this file.
# Restart `pnpm dev` after changing them.

# Where the app is served: OAuth metadata + the base of every code link.
# VITE_DOMAIN=https://atproto-qr.app

# Set to your handle to run as a personal instance (short `#name` links).
# Comment out for the regular multi-user app.
# VITE_OWNER_HANDLE=yourhandle.com
